{"id":"73113594b19a99e1","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion3-index-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Index Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-index-set — ZFC Recursion3 Index Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-index-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-index-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-index-set — ZFC Recursion3 Index Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-index-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-index-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-index-set — ZFC Recursion3 Index Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span> (set of unary partial computable maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(I\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in V\">\\(\\Phi\\in V\\)</span> (explicit enumeration of unary partial computable function graphs)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\\)</span> (partial-computable-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3IndexSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3IndexSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3IndexSet}_S(\\mathcal C,I,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(\\Phi(e))\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall f\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(\\Phi(e)=f))\\bigr)\\land\nI\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\forall f\\,(f\\in\\mathcal C\\to\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f))\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\,\\bigl(e\\in I\\leftrightarrow\\Phi(e)\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3IndexSet}_S(\\mathcal C,I,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(\\Phi(e))\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall f\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(\\Phi(e)=f))\\bigr)\\land\nI\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\forall f\\,(f\\in\\mathcal C\\to\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f))\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\,\\bigl(e\\in I\\leftrightarrow\\Phi(e)\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The enumeration is an explicit argument and is required to enumerate every unary partial computable function graph; no unbound meta-level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S$ (partial-computable-map predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3IndexSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3IndexSet}_S(\\mathcal C,I,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(\\Phi(e))\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall f\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(\\Phi(e)=f))\\bigr)\\land\nI\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\forall f\\,(f\\in\\mathcal C\\to\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f))\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\,\\bigl(e\\in I\\leftrightarrow\\Phi(e)\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false}],"bytes":1674,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion3-index-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursion3-index-set]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","278f83d281480a6e","36d7463d215be751"]}